🧠 RAG-Docs

Upload any PDF. Ask anything. Get answers grounded in your document — not hallucinated.


📌 What is RAG-Docs?
RAG-Docs is an AI-powered document chatbot built from scratch. Upload any PDF and have a real conversation with it. It uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to find the most relevant parts of your document and generate accurate answers — never making things up.

