⚙️ How it works
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │           YOUR PDF               │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │      EXTRACT TEXT (PyMuPDF)      │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │   SPLIT INTO 500-WORD CHUNKS     │
                        │   chunk_0  chunk_1  chunk_2 ...  │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │   EMBED CHUNKS → VECTORS         │
                        │   [0.23, 0.87, 0.12, 0.45...]   │
                        │   sentence-transformers          │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │   STORE IN CHROMADB (on disk)    │
                        │   vector + original text saved   │
                        └─────────────────────────────────┘


  ─────────────────────── AT QUERY TIME ───────────────────────


  ┌─────────────┐     embed      ┌──────────────┐
  │  User asks  │ ────────────▶  │   Question   │
  │  question   │                │   as vector  │
  └─────────────┘                └──────┬───────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │  SIMILARITY SEARCH IN CHROMADB   │
                        │  finds top 3 closest chunks      │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │   BUILD PROMPT                   │
                        │   context (3 chunks) + question  │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │   GROQ → LLaMA 3.3 70B           │
                        │   generates grounded answer      │
                        └────────────────┬────────────────┘
                                         │
                                         ▼
                        ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                        │   ANSWER SHOWN IN CHAT UI      │
                        └─────────────────────────────────┘

🛠️ Tech Stack
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    RAG-Docs Stack                    │
├──────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┤
│  UI              │  Streamlit                        │
│  LLM             │  LLaMA 3.3 70B (via Groq API)    │
│  Embeddings      │  all-MiniLM-L6-v2                 │
│  Vector DB       │  ChromaDB (local persistent)      │
│  PDF Parser      │  PyMuPDF (fitz)                   │
│  Language        │  Python 3.10+                     │
│  Cost            │  100% FREE ✅                     │
└──────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┘

📁 Project Structure
RAG-Docs/
│
├── app.py                 ← Streamlit web app (main file)
├── ingest.py              ← standalone PDF ingestion script
├── chat.py                ← standalone CLI chat script
├── requirements.txt       ← all dependencies
├── .gitignore             ← ignores venv, chroma_db etc.
├── README.md              ← you are here
│
└── chroma_db/             ← auto-created vector database
    └── chroma.sqlite3     ← your vectors stored here

🚀 Getting Started
1. Clone the repo
bashgit clone https://github.com/Arpitt-19/RAG-Docs.git
cd RAG-Docs
2. Create virtual environment
bash# Windows
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate

# Mac/Linux
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
3. Install dependencies
bashpip install -r requirements.txt
4. Add your Groq API key
Get a free key at  https://console.groq.com
Open app.py and replace:
pythongroq_client = Groq(api_key="YOUR_GROQ_KEY_HERE")
5. Run the app
bashstreamlit run app.py
Open your browser at http://localhost:8501 

💡 Example Questions to Try
✅ "Summarize this document in 3 bullet points"
✅ "What are the main topics covered?"
✅ "Explain [concept] from the document"
✅ "What does the document say about [topic]?"
✅ "List all the key points from chapter 2"

🧠 Why RAG and not just sending the whole PDF?
❌ Without RAG:
   Send 100 pages to AI → wastes tokens → slow → expensive
   AI might hallucinate because context is too large

✅ With RAG:
   Find only the 3 most relevant paragraphs → send those
   AI answers from exact source → accurate → fast → free
RAG = giving the AI only the pages it needs, not the whole library.

🔮 Future Improvements

